       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.           TFRTWRKMNL.
       AUTHOR.               KALMAN.
       DATE-WRITTEN.         JUNE 1993.
      *INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.

      *D* REMARKS.
      *D*     THIS IS AN ONLINE PROGRAM THAT WILL ALLOW THE USER
      *D*     TO WORK WITH UNAPPLIED PAID FREIGHT BILLS (MANUALS).
      *D*
      *C* CHANGES.
      *C*
      *C* OCT 27, 1993       CR KALMAN
      *C* THE FREIGHT AMOUNT FIELD ONLY HOLDS $9,999.99. IF THE
      *C* FREIGHT CHARGE IS GREATER THAN THIS THE FIELD WILL BE
      *C* INVERSE VIDEO. THE ACTUAL AMOUNT CAN STILL BE SEEN
      *C* WHEN INQUIRING ON THE INDIVIDUAL FREIGHT BILL.
      *C*
      *C* MAY 22, 1996       CA YODER
      *C* INCREASED SIZE OF SUBFILE.  ORIGINALLY, 1000 RECORDS WERE
      *C* PROVIDED FOR, BUT IT WAS INCREASED TO 4000 RECORDS BECAUSE
      *C* FREQUENT BLOW-UPS WERE RECORDED DUE TO THE SUBFILE SIZE.
      *C*
      *C* ALSO CORRECTED PAGING LOGIC.  AN ERROR WOULD OCCUR WHEN 1->
      *C* NO MORE MANUALS WERE FOUND IN 600-LIST-ALL-RECS, 2-> THE
      *C* LAST ONE FOUND IS THE 17TH ENTRY ON THE SCREEN (SUBFILE
      *C* SIZE PER PAGE), AND 3-> DAPPLFRT-EOF WAS NOT ENCOUNTERED
      *C* ON THAT 17TH ENTRY LAST FOUND.  WHEN THIS SITUATION OCCURS,
      *C* THE PAGING COUNTERS ARE RESET TO THE VALUES THAT EXISTED
      *C* BEFORE THEY WERE INCREMENTED FOR PERFORMING 600-LIST-ALL-
      *C* RECS.  THIS ELIMINATES THE ERROR OF READING PAST THE SUBFILE
      *C* EOF WHEN THE PAGE DOWN KEY IS USED.
      *C*
      *C* JAN 8, 2004        CA YODER
      *C* INCREASED RELATIVE RECORD NUMBER FIELDS FROM 4 TO 5
      *C* AFTER LAWTON'S MCFPCA1100 FILE EXCEEDED 9,999 RECORDS.
      *C*

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.      I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZFREIGHT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS SUBFILE-IX
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA1103
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DAPPLFRT-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPCA1100
                  ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS DAPPLFRT-IX
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC         PIC X(1000).

       FD  DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DAPPLFRT-PCP-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1100  OF MCFLCA1103.

       FD  DAPPLFRT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DAPPLFRT-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1100  OF MCFPCA1100.

       FD  MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0100  OF MCFLCA0101.

      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  Q C M D E X C   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  D A T E   &   T I M E   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  CUR-DATE.
           05  CUR-DATE-CC                PIC X(2).
           05  CUR-SYSTEM-DATE.
               10  CUR-DATE-YY            PIC X(2).
               10  CUR-DATE-MM            PIC X(2).
               10  CUR-DATE-DD            PIC X(2).

       01  CUR-TIME                      PIC X(6).

       01  SAVE-MONTH-END-DATE.
           05  SAVE-ME-DATE-CC           PIC X(2).
           05  SAVE-ME-DATE-YMD.
               10  SAVE-ME-DATE-YY       PIC X(2).
               10  SAVE-ME-DATE-MMDD     PIC X(4).

       01  SAVE-MONTH-END-TIME           PIC X(6).

       01  CONVERT-DATE.
           05  CONV-YY                   PIC X(2).
           05                            PIC X    VALUE "-".
           05  CONV-MM                   PIC X(2).
           05                            PIC X    VALUE "-".
           05  CONV-DD                   PIC X(2).

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  A R G U M E N T   V A L U E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  MACCT-ARG                PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
       01  PO-14-ARG                          VALUE SPACES.
           05  PO-11-ARG.
               10  PO-PREFIX-ARG    PIC X.
               10  PO-10-ARG.
                   15  PO-NUM-ARG   PIC X(7).
                   15  PO-RLS-ARG   PIC X(3).
           05  PO-RCVR-ARG          PIC X(3).
       01  PO-14-ARG-DUP            REDEFINES PO-14-ARG.
           05  PO-PREFIX-ARG-DUP    PIC X.
           05  PO-13-ARG            PIC X(13).
       01  RAIL-CAR-ARG             PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       01  SHIP-DATE-ARG.
           05  SHIP-DATE-CC         PIC X(2).
           05  SHIP-DATE-YYMMDD     PIC X(6).
       01  RECNUM-ARG               PIC S9(5) COMP-4.
       01  DATE-ARG.
           05  DATE-YY-ARG          PIC X(2).
           05  DATE-MM-ARG          PIC X(2).
           05  DATE-DD-ARG          PIC X(2).
       01  PRO-NO-ARG               PIC X(16).
       01  CARRIER-ARG              PIC X(4).

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  F L A G S   A N D   S W I T C H E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  DAPPLFRT-EOF             PIC X.

       01  LIST-OPTION              PIC X.
       01  SEARCH-TOGGLE            PIC X.

       01  RTN-CODE                 PIC 9.

       01  SAVE-AVG-COST-CALC-SW    PIC X(1).

       01  IN-CLOSING-PERIOD        PIC X.

       01  SAVE-RECNUM              PIC S9(5) COMP-4.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  I N D E X E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  SUBFILE-IX                    PIC  9(4).
       01  DAPPLFRT-IX                   PIC  9(5) COMP-4.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  A C C U M U L A T O R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  LOAD-LIMIT                    PIC 999.
           88  LOAD-LIMIT-REACHED        VALUE 34.
       01  SUBFILE-REC-CNT               PIC 9(4).

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  T A B L E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  B U F F E R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

      *SFL SCREEN.
       01  BUF-SCREEN1.
           05  S1-OPTION          PIC X(1).
           05  S1-ACTION          PIC X(2).
           05  S1-CARRIER         PIC X(4).
           05  S1-PRONUM          PIC X(16).
           05  S1-CAR             PIC X(10).
           05  S1-SHIPDT          PIC X(8).
           05  S1-CHARGES         PIC S9(4)V99.
           05  S1-PAIDDT          PIC X(8).
           05  S1-CANCEL          PIC X(1).
           05  S1-RECNUM          PIC S9(5) COMP-4.
           05  S1-TRUNC           PIC X(1).

      *SFLCTL SCREEN.
       01  BUF-SCREEN2.
           05  S2-RELRCD          PIC S9(5).
           05  S2-DSPREC          PIC S9(4).
           05  S2-STR-CARR        PIC X(4).
           05  S2-STR-PRO         PIC X(16).

      *FKEY & ERR MSG SCREEN FOR SFL.
       01  BUF-SCREEN3.
           05  S3-MSG-LINE        PIC X(79).

       01  SAVE-BUF-DAPPLFRT      PIC X(200).

       COPY DAPPLFRT OF COPYLIB.

       COPY MACTINFO OF COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  D A T A B A S E   S T A T U S   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X.

       COPY DBCSACCT OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DATAB    OF COPYLIB.

       01  IOFEEDBACK.
           05  IO-OFFSET                       PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  IO-OUT-COUNT                    PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  IO-GET-COUNT                    PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  IO-PUT-GET-COUNT                PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  IO-OTHER-COUNT                  PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  FILLER                          PIC X.
           05  IO-OPERATION                    PIC X.
           05  IO-FORMAT                       PIC X(10).
           05  IO-DEV-CLASS                    PIC X(2).
           05  IO-PGM-DEVICE                   PIC X(10).
           05  IO-REC-LEN                      PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  IO-RTG-DTA                      PIC X(80).
           05  IO-BLK-REC                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  IO-RESV                         PIC X(4).
           05  IO-BLK-CNT                      PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  FILLER                          PIC X(8).

           05  FEEDBACK-SIZE                   PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  JOIN-LOGICAL                    PIC X(4).
           05  KEY-OFFSET                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  LOCKED-RECORDS                  PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  MAX-FIELDS                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  FIELD-MAPPING-OFFSET            PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  CURRENT-FILE-POSITION           PIC X(1).
           05  CURRENT-RECORD-DELETE           PIC X(1).
           05  NO-OF-KEYS                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  RESERVED-FIELD                  PIC X(4).
           05  KEY-LENGTH                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  DATA-MEMBER-NO                  PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  IO-RECNUM                       PIC S9(8) COMP-4.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  T E M P O R A R Y   F I L E   P A R M S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY CCRTFILE IN COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  U T I L I T Y   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY CATREAD OF COPYLIB.

       COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.

       COPY TDATECHK OF COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.

      *COPY DISPDATA OF COPYLIB.
       01  WS-CONTROL.
           05  FUNCTION-KEY       PIC XX.
               88  ENTER-KEY-USED                       VALUE "00".
               88  F1-KEY-USED                          VALUE "01".
               88  F2-KEY-USED                          VALUE "02".
               88  F3-KEY-USED                          VALUE "03".
               88  F4-KEY-USED                          VALUE "04".
               88  F5-KEY-USED                          VALUE "05".
               88  F6-KEY-USED                          VALUE "06".
               88  F7-KEY-USED                          VALUE "07".
               88  F8-KEY-USED                          VALUE "08".
               88  F9-KEY-USED                          VALUE "09".
               88  F10-KEY-USED                         VALUE "10".
               88  F11-KEY-USED                         VALUE "11".
               88  F12-KEY-USED                         VALUE "12".
               88  ROLLUP-KEY-USED                      VALUE "RU".
           05  TERMINAL-ID        PIC X(10).
           05  FORMAT-NAME        PIC X(10).

       01  DISPLAY-STATUS         PIC X(2).

       01  SRF-INDICATORS.
           05  IND                PIC 1
                                  OCCURS 99 TIMES
                                  INDICATOR 1.
               88  IND-OFF        VALUE B"0".
               88  IND-ON         VALUE B"1".

       01  OFF-SWITCH             PIC 1  VALUE B"0".
       01  ON-SWITCH              PIC 1  VALUE B"1".

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       MAIN SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       0-CONTROL.

           PERFORM 1-HSK.

           PERFORM 6-LOOP THRU 6-LOOP-X.

           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.

           OPEN INPUT      DAPPLFRT-PCP-I      MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I.
           OPEN I-O        DISPLAY-FILE        DAPPLFRT-O.

      *----AS OF MAR 93 THE CENTURY IS NOT AVAILABLE FROM THE SYSTEM.
      *----UNTIL THE SITUATION CHANGES, THE FOLLOWING CODING IS A
      *----TEMPORARY MEASURE. THIS CODING IS USED FOR ALL DATES IN
      *----THIS PROGRAM THAT NEED CONVERSION.

           ACCEPT CUR-SYSTEM-DATE FROM DATE.
           IF CUR-DATE-YY < "70"
              MOVE "20" TO CUR-DATE-CC
           ELSE
              MOVE "19" TO CUR-DATE-CC.

      *----GET ACCOUNTING MONTH END DATE AND AVG COST FLAG.

           MOVE "MTED" TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I.
           MOVE MACCT-AVG-COST-CALC-SW TO SAVE-AVG-COST-CALC-SW.
           MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-TIME TO SAVE-MONTH-END-TIME.
           MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-DATE TO SAVE-ME-DATE-YMD.
           IF SAVE-ME-DATE-YY < "70"
              MOVE "20" TO SAVE-ME-DATE-CC
           ELSE
              MOVE "19" TO SAVE-ME-DATE-CC.


           MOVE "0" TO LIST-OPTION.
           MOVE  1  TO S2-DSPREC.

       2-EOJ.

           CLOSE           DISPLAY-FILE
                           DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
                           DAPPLFRT-O.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       6-LOOP SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       60-LOAD-SCREEN.

           INITIALIZE SUBFILE-IX, DAPPLFRT-EOF, SUBFILE-REC-CNT.

      *----SHOW SFLCTL (71) AND CLEAR SFL (72), BUT DON'T SHOW IT (70).
           MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (71)  IND (72).
           MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (70).

           WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN2
              FORMAT IS "PLSTSFLCTL"
              INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "PROBLEM ON INIT SFL WRITE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

      *----TURN CLEAR SFL OFF.

           MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (72).

       60A-GET-LIST.

           INITIALIZE BUF-SCREEN1, LOAD-LIMIT.
           MOVE SUBFILE-REC-CNT TO SUBFILE-IX.

           IF NOT ROLLUP-KEY-USED
              MOVE S2-STR-CARR  TO CARRIER-ARG
              MOVE S2-STR-PRO   TO PRO-NO-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-GE-PCP
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                 MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF
              END-IF
              IF DAPPLFRT-EOF NOT = "Y"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
                 ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      *----------------------------------
      * LIST OPTIONS:
      *      0 = LIST ALL RECS
      *      1 = LIST CANCELED RECS
      *      2=  LIST UNCANCELED RECS
      *----------------------------------

           IF LIST-OPTION = 0
              PERFORM 600-LIST-ALL-RECS.
           IF LIST-OPTION = 1
              PERFORM 601-LIST-CAN-RECS.
           IF LIST-OPTION = 2
              PERFORM 602-LIST-UNCAN-RECS.

           MOVE BUF-DAPPLFRT TO SAVE-BUF-DAPPLFRT.
           MOVE IO-RECNUM    TO SAVE-RECNUM.

      *------- RESET RECORD COUNTERS IF NO MORE MANUALS ARE FOUND
      *------- AND THE LAST ONE FOUND IS IN THE 17TH ENTRY ON THE
      *------- SCREEN.
           IF S2-DSPREC > SUBFILE-REC-CNT
               SUBTRACT 1 FROM S2-DSPREC
               IF SUBFILE-IX > 0
                   SUBTRACT 1 FROM SUBFILE-IX.

       61-SHOW-SCREEN.

      *----PUT UP FUNCTION KEY SCREEN.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN3
                 FORMAT IS "PLSTFKEY"
                 INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

      *----OVERLAY WITH SFLCTL AND SFL SCREENS.

           IF SUBFILE-IX = ZERO
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (70)
           ELSE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (70).
           MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (71).

           IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (73)
           ELSE
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (73).

           IF SEARCH-TOGGLE = "Y"
              MOVE "N" TO SEARCH-TOGGLE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (20).

           WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN2
              FORMAT IS "PLSTSFLCTL"
              INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "PROBLEM ON SHOW SFL WRITE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE DISPLAY-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

      *----READ USER INPUT.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE INTO BUF-SCREEN2
              FORMAT IS "PLSTSFLCTL"
              INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           IF IND-ON (75)
              SET ROLLUP-KEY-USED TO TRUE.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "PROBLEM ON READ SFL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       62-ACTION.

           IF ROLLUP-KEY-USED
              COMPUTE S2-DSPREC = SUBFILE-REC-CNT + 1
              MOVE SAVE-BUF-DAPPLFRT TO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              MOVE SAVE-RECNUM       TO IO-RECNUM
              GO TO 60A-GET-LIST.

           IF ENTER-KEY-USED
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F2-KEY-USED
              PERFORM 621-CALL-SFRTINQ
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F3-KEY-USED
              GO TO 6-LOOP-X.

           IF F4-KEY-USED
              PERFORM 620-CANCEL-UNCANCEL
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F5-KEY-USED
              MOVE  1  TO S2-DSPREC
              INITIALIZE S2-STR-CARR,  S2-STR-PRO
              GO TO 60-LOAD-SCREEN.

           IF F6-KEY-USED
              MOVE "Y" TO SEARCH-TOGGLE
              MOVE S2-RELRCD TO S2-DSPREC
              IF S2-DSPREC = 0
                 MOVE 1 TO S2-DSPREC
              END-IF
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F7-KEY-USED
              PERFORM 624-CALL-SFRTMCHMNL
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F8-KEY-USED
              PERFORM 622-CALL-SFRTUPDMNL
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F9-KEY-USED
              MOVE "0" TO LIST-OPTION
              MOVE  1  TO S2-DSPREC
              GO TO 60-LOAD-SCREEN.

           IF F10-KEY-USED
              MOVE "1" TO LIST-OPTION
              MOVE  1  TO S2-DSPREC
              GO TO 60-LOAD-SCREEN.

           IF F11-KEY-USED
              MOVE "2" TO LIST-OPTION
              MOVE  1  TO S2-DSPREC
              GO TO 60-LOAD-SCREEN.

       600-LIST-ALL-RECS.
           PERFORM UNTIL DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y" OR LOAD-LIMIT-REACHED
              IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE > SPACES AND DAPPL-PO-13 = SPACES
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER  TO S1-CARRIER
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO   TO S1-PRONUM
                 MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR      TO S1-CAR
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE > SPACES
                    MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                    PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                    MOVE CONVERT-DATE     TO S1-SHIPDT
                 ELSE
                    MOVE SPACES           TO S1-SHIPDT
                 END-IF
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT      TO S1-CHARGES
9310CK           IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT > 9999.99
  .                 MOVE "Y"              TO S1-TRUNC
  .              ELSE
  .                 MOVE "N"              TO S1-TRUNC
9310CK           END-IF
                 MOVE DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                 PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                 MOVE CONVERT-DATE        TO S1-PAIDDT
                 MOVE DAPPL-STATUS        TO S1-CANCEL
                 MOVE IO-RECNUM           TO S1-RECNUM
                 ADD 1 TO SUBFILE-IX, SUBFILE-REC-CNT, LOAD-LIMIT
                 IF SUBFILE-IX > 4000
                    MOVE "SUBFILE TOO SMALL-INCREASE PLSTSFL/ZFREIGHT"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
                 IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                    MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
                 ELSE
                    MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 END-IF
                 WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                    FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                    INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 END-WRITE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
                    MOVE "PROBLEM ON LOAD SFL WRITE -- #1"
                                                     TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE S1-CARRIER TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    MOVE S1-PRONUM TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                    MOVE S1-CAR TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                    MOVE S1-PAIDDT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
              ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
           END-PERFORM.

       601-LIST-CAN-RECS.
           PERFORM UNTIL DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y" OR LOAD-LIMIT-REACHED
              IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE > SPACES
               AND DAPPL-PO-13 = SPACES
                AND DAPPL-STATUS-1 = "X"
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER  TO S1-CARRIER
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO   TO S1-PRONUM
                 MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR      TO S1-CAR
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE > SPACES
                    MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                    PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                    MOVE CONVERT-DATE     TO S1-SHIPDT
                 ELSE
                    MOVE SPACES           TO S1-SHIPDT
                 END-IF
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT      TO S1-CHARGES
9310CK           IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT > 9999.99
  .                 MOVE "Y"              TO S1-TRUNC
  .              ELSE
  .                 MOVE "N"              TO S1-TRUNC
9310CK           END-IF
                 MOVE DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                 PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                 MOVE CONVERT-DATE        TO S1-PAIDDT
                 MOVE DAPPL-STATUS        TO S1-CANCEL
                 MOVE IO-RECNUM           TO S1-RECNUM
                 ADD 1 TO SUBFILE-IX, SUBFILE-REC-CNT, LOAD-LIMIT
                 IF SUBFILE-IX > 4000
                    MOVE "SUBFILE TOO SMALL-INCREASE PLSTSFL/ZFREIGHT"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
                 IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                    MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
                 ELSE
                    MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 END-IF
                 WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                    FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                    INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 END-WRITE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
                    MOVE "PROBLEM ON LOAD SFL WRITE -- #2"
                                                     TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE S1-CARRIER TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    MOVE S1-PRONUM TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                    MOVE S1-CAR TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                    MOVE S1-PAIDDT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
              ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
           END-PERFORM.

       602-LIST-UNCAN-RECS.
           PERFORM UNTIL DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y" OR LOAD-LIMIT-REACHED
              IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE > SPACES
               AND DAPPL-PO-13 = SPACES
                AND DAPPL-STATUS-1 NOT = "X"
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER  TO S1-CARRIER
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO   TO S1-PRONUM
                 MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR      TO S1-CAR
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE > SPACES
                    MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                    PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                    MOVE CONVERT-DATE     TO S1-SHIPDT
                 ELSE
                    MOVE SPACES           TO S1-SHIPDT
                 END-IF
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT      TO S1-CHARGES
9310CK           IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT > 9999.99
  .                 MOVE "Y"              TO S1-TRUNC
  .              ELSE
  .                 MOVE "N"              TO S1-TRUNC
9310CK           END-IF
                 MOVE DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                 PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                 MOVE CONVERT-DATE        TO S1-PAIDDT
                 MOVE DAPPL-STATUS        TO S1-CANCEL
                 MOVE IO-RECNUM           TO S1-RECNUM
                 ADD 1 TO SUBFILE-IX, SUBFILE-REC-CNT, LOAD-LIMIT
                 IF SUBFILE-IX > 4000
                    MOVE "SUBFILE TOO SMALL-INCREASE PLSTSFL/ZFREIGHT"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
                 IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                    MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
                 ELSE
                    MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 END-IF
                 WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                    FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                    INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 END-WRITE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
                    MOVE "PROBLEM ON LOAD SFL WRITE -- #3"
                                                     TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE S1-CARRIER TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    MOVE S1-PRONUM TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                    MOVE S1-CAR TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                    MOVE S1-PAIDDT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
              ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
           END-PERFORM.

       620-CANCEL-UNCANCEL.

      *----FIND FIRST SUBFILE REC TO CANCEL/UNCANCEL.

           PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
              READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                   INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                   FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
           END-PERFORM

           IF S1-OPTION = "X"
              MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO S2-DSPREC
           ELSE
              MOVE S2-RELRCD  TO S2-DSPREC.
           IF S2-DSPREC < 1
              MOVE 1 TO S2-DSPREC.

           INITIALIZE DAPPLFRT-EOF.

           PERFORM UNTIL DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO

      *-------FIND THE RECORD IN DAPPLFRT

              MOVE S1-RECNUM TO RECNUM-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O

              IF DAPPL-PO-13 = SPACES
                 IF DAPPL-STATUS-1 = "X"
                    MOVE SPACES TO DAPPL-STATUS-1
                 ELSE
                    MOVE "X" TO DAPPL-STATUS-1
                 END-IF
                 MOVE CUR-DATE TO DAPPL-STATUS-DATE

      *----------UPDATE THE SUBFILE RECORD

                 IF S1-CANCEL = "X"
                    MOVE SPACES TO S1-CANCEL
                    MOVE "4U" TO S1-ACTION
                 ELSE
                    MOVE "X" TO S1-CANCEL
                    MOVE "4C" TO S1-ACTION
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              INITIALIZE S1-OPTION

      *-------REWRITE OF DAPPLFRT WILL BE PERFORMED IF A CHANGED
      *-------OCCURED OR NOT.  IT ACTS AS A "RESET" PARAGRAPH.

              PERFORM 9999-REWRITE-DAPPLFRT-O

              IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                 MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
              ELSE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
              END-IF
              REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                 FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                 INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-REWRITE
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)

      *-------GET NEXT SUBFILE RECORD TO CANCEL/UNCANCEL

              PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
                 READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                      INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                      FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                 END-READ
              END-PERFORM

           END-PERFORM.

       621-CALL-SFRTINQ.

      *----FIND FIRST SUBFILE REC TO INQUIRE.

           PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
              READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                   INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                   FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
           END-PERFORM

           IF S1-OPTION = "X"
              MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO S2-DSPREC
           ELSE
              MOVE S2-RELRCD  TO S2-DSPREC.
           IF S2-DSPREC < 1
              MOVE 1 TO S2-DSPREC.

           PERFORM UNTIL DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO

              CALL "SFRTINQ" USING S1-RECNUM, RTN-CODE,
                                   BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-FLDS

              IF RTN-CODE NOT = 0
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
              END-IF

      *-------UPDATE THE SUBFILE RECORD

              MOVE "2" TO S1-ACTION
              INITIALIZE S1-OPTION

              IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                 MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
              ELSE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
              END-IF
              REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                 FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                 INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-REWRITE
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)

      *-------GET NEXT SUBFILE RECORD TO INQUIRE

              PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
                 READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                      INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                      FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                 END-READ
              END-PERFORM

           END-PERFORM.

       622-CALL-SFRTUPDMNL.

      *----FIND FIRST SUBFILE REC TO UPDATE.

           PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
              READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                   INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                   FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
           END-PERFORM.

           IF S1-OPTION = "X"
              MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO S2-DSPREC
           ELSE
              MOVE S2-RELRCD  TO S2-DSPREC.
           IF S2-DSPREC < 1
              MOVE 1 TO S2-DSPREC.

      *----IF IN CLOSING OR AVERAGE COSTING HAS BEEN DONE NO FREIGHT
      *----BILLS CAN BE APPLIED SO DROP OUT OF THIS PARA.

           PERFORM 6220-CHECK-FOR-ME-CLOSING.

      *----IF RETURN FROM ABOVE PARA THEN IT'S OKAY TO UPDATE BILLS.

           PERFORM UNTIL DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO

              CALL "SFRTUPDMNL" USING S1-RECNUM, RTN-CODE,
                                   BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-FLDS

              IF RTN-CODE  > 1
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
              END-IF

      *-------UPDATE THE SUBFILE RECORD

              INITIALIZE S1-OPTION
              IF RTN-CODE = 0
                 MOVE "8U" TO S1-ACTION
                 INITIALIZE   S1-CANCEL
              ELSE
                 MOVE "8 " TO S1-ACTION
              END-IF

              IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                 MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
              ELSE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
              END-IF
              REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                 FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                 INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-REWRITE
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)

      *-------GET NEXT SUBFILE RECORD TO UPDATE

              PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
                 READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                      INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                      FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                 END-READ
              END-PERFORM

           END-PERFORM.

       624-CALL-SFRTMCHMNL.

      *----FIND FIRST SUBFILE REC TO MATCH.

           PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
              READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                   INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                   FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
           END-PERFORM.

           IF S1-OPTION = "X"
              MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO S2-DSPREC
           ELSE
              MOVE S2-RELRCD  TO S2-DSPREC.
           IF S2-DSPREC < 1
              MOVE 1 TO S2-DSPREC.

      *----IF IN CLOSING OR AVERAGE COSTING HAS BEEN DONE NO FREIGHT
      *----BILLS CAN BE APPLIED SO DROP OUT OF THIS PARA.

           PERFORM 6220-CHECK-FOR-ME-CLOSING.

      *----IF RETURN FROM ABOVE PARA THEN IT'S OKAY TO UPDATE BILLS.

           PERFORM UNTIL DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO

              MOVE S1-RECNUM TO RECNUM-ARG
                 CALL "SFRTMCHMNL" USING RECNUM-ARG, RTN-CODE

      *-------UPDATE THE SUBFILE RECORD

              INITIALIZE S1-OPTION
              IF RTN-CODE = 0
                 MOVE "7U" TO S1-ACTION
                 INITIALIZE   S1-CANCEL
              ELSE
                 MOVE "7 " TO S1-ACTION
              END-IF

              IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                 MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
              ELSE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
              END-IF
              REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                 FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                 INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-REWRITE
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)

      *-------GET NEXT SUBFILE RECORD TO UPDATE

              PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
                 READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                      INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                      FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                 END-READ
              END-PERFORM

           END-PERFORM.

       6220-CHECK-FOR-ME-CLOSING.

           IF SAVE-AVG-COST-CALC-SW NOT = SPACES
      *       ***  CANNOT UPDATE UNTIL CLOSING IS COMPLETE  ***
              MOVE 03614 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 9999-CATREAD
              MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO S3-MSG-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND(99)

              PERFORM UNTIL DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO

                 INITIALIZE S1-OPTION

                 IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                    MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
                 ELSE
                    MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 END-IF
                 REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                    FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                    INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                    INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                 END-REWRITE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)

      *----------GET NEXT SUBFILE RECORD TO CLEAR

                 PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X"
                         OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
                    READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                         INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                         FORMAT IS "PLSTSFL"
                    END-READ
                 END-PERFORM
              END-PERFORM

              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

       6-LOOP-X.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       9999-UTILITY SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       9999-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TFRTWRKMNL" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
              VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
              BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE DATE-YY-ARG TO CONV-YY.
           MOVE DATE-MM-ARG TO CONV-MM.
           MOVE DATE-DD-ARG TO CONV-DD.

       9999-WRITE-SCREEN.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
      *??? MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

       9999-READ-SCREEN.
           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
      *??? MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

      *--- A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *--- IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.

           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "03" TO FUNCTION-KEY.

       9999-CATREAD.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.

      *---------------------------------
      * DAPPLFRT
      *---------------------------------
       9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-GE-PCP.
           MOVE CARRIER-ARG TO PDCARRIER OF DAPPLFRT-PCP-REC-I.
           MOVE PRO-NO-ARG  TO PDPRONO   OF DAPPLFRT-PCP-REC-I.
           START DAPPLFRT-PCP-I KEY >= EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "START DAPPLFRT-PCP*9999-SDIGP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE CARRIER-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE PRO-NO-ARG  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-PCP-I NEXT INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF.

       9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O.
           MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO DAPPLFRT-IX.
           READ DAPPLFRT-O INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
                INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "READ DAPPLFRT*9999-RDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-REWRITE-DAPPLFRT-O.
           REWRITE DAPPLFRT-REC-O FROM BUF-DAPPLFRT
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "REWRITE DAPPLFRT*9999-RDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE DAPPL-PO-14 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
              MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

      *---------------------------------
      * MACCOUNT-INFO
      *---------------------------------

       9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I.
           MOVE MACCT-ARG TO INFOKEY OF MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-REC-I.
           READ MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "READ MACCOUNT-INFO*9999-RMIKO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE MACCT-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

